  "description": "<p>Welcome guests with a personalized Christian doormat, featuring uplifting Bible verses and faith-based designs. This doormat serves as a warm invitation, blending spiritual inspiration with everyday utility. It's an ideal choice for enhancing your home's entryway or as a meaningful gift for believers on various special occasions, creating a welcoming atmosphere at your doorstep.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with family name, initial, or custom text alongside a Bible verse</li>\n<li>Features inspirational scripture-based designs</li>\n<li>Soft, lightweight, and comfortable underfoot</li>\n<li>Offers durability and a soft landing</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bible Verse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Personalization</td>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester Fabric, Memory Stretch Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Gently soak spilled liquid with dry duster cloth or clean stain with water. For solid waste, use hand-held vacuum cleaner, broom, or shake off outdoors. For deeper cleaning, wipe with damp cloth and mild soap, or flush outdoors with garden hose.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is perfectly suited for various entryways, including front porches and indoor entrances. Its durable construction allows for versatile placement, making it a thoughtful addition to any home.</p>",
